#: src/ashytv/window.py:1185
msgid ""
"A few steps over the real screens: channels, guide, movies, playlists and "
"settings. You can reopen it from the main menu."
msgstr ""
"Pochi passi sulle schermate reali: canali, guida, film, playlist e "
"impostazioni. Puoi riaprirla dal menu principale."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1187
msgid "Not now"
